  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support 40 Girls  to Finish High School in China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the impact of traditional ideas, the phenomenon of preference for sons over daughters still exists widely in the rural area of China. The tuition and living expenses create a heavy financial burden for some low-income families. The scholarship program combines tuition fund and psychological lessons together in order to help poor high school girls spend their high school in an easier way and enhance their career planning and finally giving them more enriching possibilities for their lives.</narrative>
  </description>
